{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a premium Interactive Editorial Cards section with a horizontal row of 5 vertical rounded cards.
    
    The interaction should work by changing the width of the cards, not by scaling them.
    
    Desktop Layout
    Display 5 cards in one row.
    Each card should have a tall portrait aspect ratio with large rounded corners (pill shape).
    The section should span the full width of the page.
    Cards should have a small consistent gap between them.
    Show only the centre 3 cards fully.
    The first and fifth cards should be partially visible on the left and right edges.
    
    Use Flexbox for the layout.
    
    Default widths should be approximately:
    
    15% | 27.5% | 27.5% | 15% | 15%
    
    (or another proportional layout that produces the same visual result.)
    
    Hover Behaviour
    
    When hovering over a card:
    
    Do NOT scale or zoom the card.
    
    Instead:
    
    Smoothly increase that card's width.
    Smoothly reduce the widths of the remaining cards.
    Keep the overall row width exactly the same.
    The card height must never change.
    Border radius must remain unchanged.
    Images should not stretch.
    Images should use object-fit: cover.
    
    Example:
    
    Before hover
    
    15% | 27.5% | 27.5% | 15% | 15%
    
    Hover second card
    
    12% | 40% | 18% | 15% | 15%
    
    Hover fourth card
    
    12% | 15% | 18% | 40% | 15%
    
    The transition should feel smooth and luxurious.
    
    Transition duration:
    
    350ms–450ms
    ease
    Card Content
    
    Each card should support:
    
    Background Image
    Heading
    Subtitle
    Optional Description
    Optional Button
    Product Link
    Collection Link
    
    Entire card should be clickable.
    
    Text Animation
    
    When hovered:
    
    Heading increases slightly (around 5%)
    Subtitle fades in if hidden
    Description fades in
    Button fades in
    
    Do NOT animate the card using transform: scale().
    
    Only animate opacity, font size and width.
    
    Product Integration
    
    Each card should allow selecting either:
    
    Product
    or
    Collection
    
    If a product is selected:
    
    Automatically populate title
    Automatically populate featured image (optional)
    Link directly to the product
    
    If a collection is selected:
    
    Automatically populate collection image
    Automatically populate collection title
    Link directly to the collection
    
    Allow manual overrides.
    
    Typography
    
    Provide font controls for:
    
    Section Heading
    
    Section Subtitle
    
    Card Heading
    
    Card Subtitle
    
    Description
    
    Button
    
    Each should allow editing:
    
    Font Family
    Font Size
    Font Weight
    Letter Spacing
    Line Height
    Text Colour
    Text Transform
    
    Do not hardcode fonts.
    
    Section Settings
    
    Allow editing of:
    
    Section Width
    Card Height
    Card Gap
    Border Radius
    Overlay Colour
    Overlay Opacity
    Image Brightness
    Image Position
    Vertical Content Alignment
    Horizontal Content Alignment
    Hover Transition Speed
    Mobile Layout
    
    On mobile:
    
    Stack all five cards vertically.
    Full-width cards.
    Keep the same rounded corners.
    Disable the width animation.
    Cards should simply display one beneath another with spacing.
    Performance
    Use Flexbox.
    Animate using flex-grow or flex-basis.
    Avoid transform: scale().
    No layout jumps.
    Maintain smooth 60fps animations.
    Overall Design Style
    
    The finished section should feel:
    
    Minimal
    Editorial
    Luxury
    Fashion-forward
    Premium eyewear
    Similar in interaction to Apple TV, Gentle Monster and high-end fashion websites.
    
    The entire section must be fully editable from the Shopify Theme Editor with no hardcoded content., Give me only 3 sections.
    Make the background of the section black. 
    
    IN cards, allow me to add a picture and also link that with a product.
    
    Give me text in each card over the image. 
    
    GIve me imahe opacity for the text overlay in each card., Give me option to control the radius of each card seperately in mobile and computer version.
    
    ALso add a heading and sub heading above the cards., Give me padding on both right and left sides in compurter mode and give me an option to control the padding.
    
    Give me text for each card that read as:
    
    Card 1: Aero
    Card 2: Atlas
    Card 3: Elite
    
    Below the text give me a button for each card that reads Explore.
    
    Button style should be link style and when hovered on the card, the underline should form under the button. and the text increases the size by 1 px.
    
    Make the radius of each card as 80 px by default in computer mode, The 3rd card is being cut off, correct that, Give me option to select alignment for text inside the cards like top center and bottom. left, middle and right, Give me more space between cards 
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-editorial-cards-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: 100%;
    display: block;
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px {{ block.settings.section_padding_horizontal }}px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.section_background_color }};
  }

  .ai-editorial-cards__container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-width: {{ block.settings.section_width }}px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .ai-editorial-cards__header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    text-align: {{ block.settings.header_alignment }};
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.header_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-editorial-cards__title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.section_heading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.section_heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.section_heading_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.section_heading_size }}px;
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.section_heading_letter_spacing }}em;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.section_heading_line_height }};
    text-transform: {{ block.settings.section_heading_transform }};
    color: {{ block.settings.section_heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.section_subtitle_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-editorial-cards__subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.section_subtitle_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.section_subtitle_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.section_subtitle_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.section_subtitle_size }}px;
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.section_subtitle_letter_spacing }}em;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.section_subtitle_line_height }};
    text-transform: {{ block.settings.section_subtitle_transform }};
    color: {{ block.settings.section_subtitle_color }};
    margin: 0;
  }

  .ai-editorial-cards__row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    gap: {{ block.settings.card_gap }}px;
    width: 100%;
  }

  .ai-editorial-card-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    height: {{ block.settings.card_height }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
    transition: flex-basis {{ block.settings.transition_speed }}ms ease, flex-grow {{ block.settings.transition_speed }}ms ease;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .ai-editorial-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(1) {
    flex-basis: {{ block.settings.card_1_default_width }}%;
    flex-grow: 0;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_1_border_radius }}px;
  }

  .ai-editorial-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(2) {
    flex-basis: {{ block.settings.card_2_default_width }}%;
    flex-grow: 0;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_2_border_radius }}px;
  }

  .ai-editorial-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(3) {
    flex-basis: {{ block.settings.card_3_default_width }}%;
    flex-grow: 0;
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_3_border_radius }}px;
  }

  .ai-editorial-cards__row-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-editorial-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(1):not(:hover) {
    flex-basis: {{ block.settings.card_1_hover_width }}%;
  }

  .ai-editorial-cards__row-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-editorial-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(2):not(:hover) {
    flex-basis: {{ block.settings.card_2_hover_width }}%;
  }

  .ai-editorial-cards__row-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-editorial-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(3):not(:hover) {
    flex-basis: {{ block.settings.card_3_hover_width }}%;
  }

  .ai-editorial-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    flex-basis: {{ block.settings.card_active_width }}% !important;
  }

  .ai-editorial-card__link-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: inherit;
  }

  .ai-editorial-card__image-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: absolute;
    top: 0;
    left: 0;
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: {{ block.settings.image_position }};
  }

  .ai-editorial-card__content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    padding: {{ block.settings.card_padding }}px;
  }

  .ai-editorial-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(1) .ai-editorial-card__content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    justify-content: {{ block.settings.card_1_vertical_alignment }};
    align-items: {{ block.settings.card_1_horizontal_alignment }};
    text-align: {{ block.settings.card_1_text_alignment }};
  }

  .ai-editorial-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(2) .ai-editorial-card__content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    justify-content: {{ block.settings.card_2_vertical_alignment }};
    align-items: {{ block.settings.card_2_horizontal_alignment }};
    text-align: {{ block.settings.card_2_text_alignment }};
  }

  .ai-editorial-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(3) .ai-editorial-card__content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    justify-content: {{ block.settings.card_3_vertical_alignment }};
    align-items: {{ block.settings.card_3_horizontal_alignment }};
    text-align: {{ block.settings.card_3_text_alignment }};
  }

  .ai-editorial-card__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.card_heading_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.card_heading_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.card_heading_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_heading_size }}px;
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.card_heading_letter_spacing }}em;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.card_heading_line_height }};
    text-transform: {{ block.settings.card_heading_transform }};
    color: {{ block.settings.card_heading_color }};
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.card_heading_spacing }}px;
    transition: font-size {{ block.settings.transition_speed }}ms ease;
  }

  .ai-editorial-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-editorial-card__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: calc({{ block.settings.card_heading_size }}px * 1.05);
  }

  .ai-editorial-card__subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.card_subtitle_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.card_subtitle_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.card_subtitle_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.card_subtitle_size }}px;
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.card_subtitle_letter_spacing }}em;
    line-height: {{ block.settings.card_subtitle_line_height }};
    text-transform: {{ block.settings.card_subtitle_transform }};
    color: {{ block.settings.card_subtitle_color }};
    margin: 0 0 {{ block.settings.button_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-editorial-card__button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-family: {{ block.settings.button_font.family }}, {{ block.settings.button_font.fallback_families }};
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.button_font.weight }};
    font-size: {{ block.settings.button_size }}px;
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.button_letter_spacing }}em;
    text-transform: {{ block.settings.button_transform }};
    color: {{ block.settings.button_color }};
    background: none;
    border: none;
    padding: 0;
    cursor: pointer;
    position: relative;
    display: inline-block;
    transition: font-size {{ block.settings.transition_speed }}ms ease;
  }

  .ai-editorial-card__button-{{ ai_gen_id }}::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -2px;
    left: 0;
    width: 0;
    height: 1px;
    background-color: {{ block.settings.button_color }};
    transition: width {{ block.settings.transition_speed }}ms ease;
  }

  .ai-editorial-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-editorial-card__button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: calc({{ block.settings.button_size }}px + 1px);
  }

  .ai-editorial-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-editorial-card__button-{{ ai_gen_id }}::after {
    width: 100%;
  }

  @media screen and (max-width: 989px) {
    .ai-editorial-cards-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px {{ block.settings.mobile_section_padding_horizontal }}px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
    }

    .ai-editorial-cards__row-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: {{ block.settings.mobile_card_gap }}px;
    }

    .ai-editorial-card-{{ ai_gen_id }},
    .ai-editorial-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(1),
    .ai-editorial-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(2),
    .ai-editorial-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(3) {
      flex-basis: auto !important;
      width: 100%;
      height: {{ block.settings.mobile_card_height }}px;
    }

    .ai-editorial-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(1) {
      border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_1_mobile_border_radius }}px;
    }

    .ai-editorial-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(2) {
      border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_2_mobile_border_radius }}px;
    }

    .ai-editorial-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(3) {
      border-radius: {{ block.settings.card_3_mobile_border_radius }}px;
    }

    .ai-editorial-cards__row-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-editorial-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(1):not(:hover),
    .ai-editorial-cards__row-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-editorial-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(2):not(:hover),
    .ai-editorial-cards__row-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-editorial-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}:nth-child(3):not(:hover) {
      flex-basis: auto !important;
    }

    .ai-editorial-cards__title-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.section_heading_size | times: 0.7 }}px;
    }

    .ai-editorial-cards__subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.section_subtitle_size | times: 0.8 }}px;
    }

    .ai-editorial-card__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.card_heading_size | times: 0.8 }}px;
    }

    .ai-editorial-card__subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.card_subtitle_size | times: 0.8 }}px;
    }

    .ai-editorial-card__button-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.button_size | times: 0.9 }}px;
    }
  }
{% endstyle %}

<editorial-cards-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-editorial-cards-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-editorial-cards__container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.section_title != blank or block.settings.section_subtitle != blank %}
      <div class="ai-editorial-cards__header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
        {% if block.settings.section_title != blank %}
          <h2 class="ai-editorial-cards__title-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.section_title }}</h2>
        {% endif %}
        {% if block.settings.section_subtitle != blank %}
          <p class="ai-editorial-cards__subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.section_subtitle }}</p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
    {% endif %}

    <div class="ai-editorial-cards__row-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
      {% for i in (1..3) %}
        {% liquid
  assign card_enabled_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_enabled'
  assign card_product_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_product'
  assign card_collection_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_collection'
  assign card_image_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_image'
  assign card_overlay_opacity_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_overlay_opacity'
  assign card_heading_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_heading'
  assign card_subtitle_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_subtitle'
  assign card_button_text_key = 'card_' | append: i | append: '_button_text'

  assign card_enabled = block.settings[card_enabled_key]
  assign card_product = block.settings[card_product_key]
  assign card_collection = block.settings[card_collection_key]
  assign card_image = block.settings[card_image_key]
  assign card_overlay_opacity = block.settings[card_overlay_opacity_key]
  assign card_heading = block.settings[card_heading_key]
  assign card_subtitle = block.settings[card_subtitle_key]
  assign card_button_text = block.settings[card_button_text_key]

  assign final_image = card_image
  assign final_heading = card_heading
  assign final_link = ''

  if card_product != blank
    if final_image == blank
      assign final_image = card_product.featured_image
    endif
    if final_heading == blank
      assign final_heading = card_product.title
    endif
    assign final_link = card_product.url
  elsif card_collection != blank
    if final_image == blank
      assign final_image = card_collection.image
    endif
    if final_image == blank and card_collection.products.first != blank
      assign final_image = card_collection.products.first.featured_image
    endif
    if final_heading == blank
      assign final_heading = card_collection.title
    endif
    assign final_link = card_collection.url
  endif
%}

        {% if card_enabled %}
          <div class="ai-editorial-card-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
            <a href="{{ final_link | default: '#' }}" class="ai-editorial-card__link-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              {% if final_image != blank %}
                <img
                  src="{{ final_image | image_url: width: 800 }}"
                  alt="{{ final_image.alt | escape }}"
                  class="ai-editorial-card__image-{{ ai_gen_id }}"
                  loading="lazy"
                  width="800"
                  height="{{ block.settings.card_height }}"
                  style="opacity: {{ card_overlay_opacity }};"
                >
              {% else %}
                <div class="ai-editorial-card__image-{{ ai_gen_id }}" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%); opacity: {{ card_overlay_opacity }};"></div>
              {% endif %}

              <div class="ai-editorial-card__content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
                {% if final_heading != blank %}
                  <h3 class="ai-editorial-card__heading-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ final_heading }}</h3>
                {% endif %}

                {% if card_subtitle != blank %}
                  <p class="ai-editorial-card__subtitle-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ card_subtitle }}</p>
                {% endif %}

                {% if card_button_text != blank %}
                  <span class="ai-editorial-card__button-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ card_button_text }}</span>
                {% endif %}
              </div>
            </a>
          </div>
        {% endif %}
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</editorial-cards-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Editorial cards",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Section"
    },
    {
      "type": "color",
      "id": "section_background_color",
      "label": "Background color",
      "default": "#000000"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "section_width",
      "label": "Maximum width",
      "min": 1000,
      "max": 2000,
      "step": 50,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 1600
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "section_padding_horizontal",
      "label": "Horizontal padding (desktop)",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 200,
      "step": 10,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 80
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "mobile_section_padding_horizontal",
      "label": "Horizontal padding (mobile)",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 20
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "section_padding_top",
      "label": "Padding top",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 150,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 60
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "section_padding_bottom",
      "label": "Padding bottom",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 150,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 60
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "desktop_width_percent",
      "label": "Desktop width",
      "min": 50,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "%",
      "default": 100
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Section header"
    },
    {
      "type": "inline_richtext",
      "id": "section_title",
      "label": "Title",
      "default": "Featured Collection"
    },
    {
      "type": "inline_richtext",
      "id": "section_subtitle",
      "label": "Subtitle",
      "default": "Discover our latest styles"
    },
    {
      "type": "select",
      "id": "header_alignment",
      "label": "Alignment",
      "options": [
        { "value": "left", "label": "Left" },
        { "value": "center", "label": "Center" },
        { "value": "right", "label": "Right" }
      ],
      "default": "center"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "header_spacing",
      "label": "Spacing below header",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 100,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 50
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Card dimensions"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "card_height",
      "label": "Card height (desktop)",
      "min": 400,
      "max": 900,
      "step": 10,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 700
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "mobile_card_height",
      "label": "Card height (mobile)",
      "min": 300,
      "max": 600,
      "step": 10,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 450
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "card_gap",
      "label": "Gap between cards (desktop)",
      "min": 5,
      "max": 60,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 30
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "mobile_card_gap",
      "label": "Gap between cards (mobile)",
      "min": 10,
      "max": 50,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 20
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "card_padding",
      "label": "Card content padding",
      "min": 20,
      "max": 80,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 40
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Card border radius (desktop)"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "card_1_border_radius",
      "label": "Card 1 radius",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 150,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 80
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "card_2_border_radius",
      "label": "Card 2 radius",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 150,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 80
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
      "id": "card_3_border_radius",
      "label": "Card 3 radius",
      "min": 0,
      "max": 150,
      "step": 5,
      "unit": "px",
      "default": 80
    },
    {
      "type": "header",
      "content": "Card border radius (mobile)"
    },
    {
      "type": "range",
